Do not follow calls to addresses outside RAM.
No seguir llamadas a direcciones fuera de la RAM.

The Nintendo SDK's __OSDBJump (0x80251B90 in Animal Parade, 0x8016F6B0 in Magical Melody) ends
with `bla 0x60`, a jump into the console's debugger stub. A retail console never takes it, but
translate-recursive follows every call and stops with "Address 0x00000060 is outside the loaded
RAM image". This skips any queued address outside the program image.

__OSDBJump del SDK termina con `bla 0x60`, un salto al depurador de la consola. Una consola de
venta nunca lo toma, pero translate-recursive sigue cada llamada y se detiene con "Address
0x00000060 is outside the loaded RAM image". Esto salta cualquier dirección fuera de la imagen.

Applies to WiiCompiled commit 27ff3b0 / Se aplica a WiiCompiled 27ff3b0:
    git apply /path/to/harvest-moon-ap-recomp/patches/wiicompiled/skip-calls-outside-ram.patch

diff --git a/translator/src/Translator.Cli/Program.cs b/translator/src/Translator.Cli/Program.cs
index e1164dd..55622b0 100644
--- a/translator/src/Translator.Cli/Program.cs
+++ b/translator/src/Translator.Cli/Program.cs
@@ -645,6 +645,14 @@ int RunTranslateRecursive(string[] argsTail)
                 return true;
             }
 
+            // A call that leaves RAM is not a function of the game. The SDK's __OSDBJump
+            // ends with `bla 0x60`, a jump into the console's debugger stub, which a
+            // retail console never reaches. There is nothing to translate there.
+            if (!image.Value.Contains(item.addr, sizeof(uint)))
+            {
+                return true;
+            }
+
             return false;
         }
 
